  "description": "God, I only asked for mercy—why resurrect me?\n\n *“Any final words?”\n\n“...God, have mercy.”*\n\nI was betrayed by those I trusted and ultimately beheaded. But with the divine decree, the world turned upside down. \n\n *Evil runs rampant; I send you the resurrected. Stand firm against them.*\n\nGod. I asked you to have mercy on them, not to resurrect me. Can't you just let them perish?\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
